+The referral program EXISTS and is live. When someone you invited makes their first subscription payment, EACH level of the invite chain above them, up to 6 levels of who-invited-whom, gets a full 5% of that first payment — 5% each, not one 5% split between the levels. On an annual plan the base is one month of it; later payments add nothing. Your balance can be withdrawn from $10, or spent on tokens or on a month of subscription. Invites are framed as your own gain or a gift to a friend — never pressure. If asked for details beyond this (payout timing, currency, tax) — say the team can answer precisely; do not invent.
\ No newline at end of file
